  <StreamGeometry x:Key="Icon.GeneratorPlus">M2 6 H13 M2 10 H13 M7 2 L6 14 M11 2 L10 14 M18.5 15 V22 M15 18.5 H22</StreamGeometry>
  <!-- New Domain: a small diamond (top-left, matching the metadata-tree Domain glyph
