  <!-- ============================================================================
       Metadata object kinds (Etap 2) — one geometry per MetadataObjectKind, keyed
       "Icon.<KindName>" so MetadataNodeViewModel.GeometryKeyFor(kind) = $"Icon.{kind}".
       Resolved at render time via IconGeometryConverter; color flows separately through
       IconBrushConverter + the per-kind IconColor_* tokens. All authentic Lucide except
       Domain (diamond) / Generator (hash) authored as clean primitives, and circles/
       ellipses written in canonical relative-arc form. Plus tree-chrome icons: Query
       (SQL editor tab), Connection (root node), Folder (connection folders). -->
